# 👥 Team Availability Tracker

## 📌 Overview

Team Availability Tracker is a Python application designed to monitor and manage team member availability. It allows organizations, project teams, and managers to keep track of employee statuses such as Available, Busy, On Leave, and Offline.

The project demonstrates file handling, CRUD operations, data management, and menu-driven programming concepts in Python.

---

## ✨ Features

* Add team members
* Track availability status
* Search employee records
* Update availability information
* Delete team members
* Persistent CSV storage
* Command-line interface

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python 3.x
* CSV Module
* File Handling
* Functions
* Exception Handling

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
team-availability-tracker/
