```

---

## 🚀 Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/team-availability-tracker.git
cd team-availability-tracker
python main.py
```

---

## 📋 Sample Output

```text
Name       : John Smith
Department : Development
Status     : Available
```

---

## 🔄 Workflow

1. Add Team Member
2. Assign Availability Status
3. Store Information
4. Search or Update Status
5. View Team Dashboard
6. Delete Records if Required

